  "_type": "issue",
  "id": "budget-1iym",
  "title": "Bank sync is idempotent: a bank id already imported anywhere is skipped, never a crash",
  "description": "Itaú connection c4189214 fails every sync: duplicate key on connection_transactions (provider, external_transaction_id). api/src/connections/sync.ts looks up existing rows only by account_id + import_id + NOT deleted, but the shadow unique key is global. A row deleted (by the user or by the sync's tombstone sweep) or living in another account (unlinked/relinked) makes the INSERT fail and the whole transaction rolls back.",
  "status": "closed",
  "priority": 0,
  "issue_type": "task",
  "owner": null,
  "assignee": null,
  "created_by": "yuri",
  "created_at": "2026-11-23T16:59:18.920Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-23T18:59:02.830Z",
  "started_at": null,
  "closed_at": "2026-11-23T18:58:39.642Z",
  "due_at": null,
  "defer_until": null,
  "parent": null,
  "sprint": null,
  "labels": [],
  "notes": "Implemented: global (provider, bank id) lookup incl. deleted before insert -> skipped_deleted / skipped_other_account (+ skipped_accounts with name when same budget); SAVEPOINT per row -> failed + failures (job log only, stripped from sync-status); bank page (ConnectionSettingsScreen) shows a yellow line per reason from last_run.result (en + pt-BR). Tests: api 1195 pass (incl. 5 new in sync-idempotent.test.ts), shared 163, client 1235; tsc + eslint clean in api/shared/client, admin tsc clean. Test DB on compose :55432 (5432 rejects postgres:postgres), dropped after.\nRebased onto tk/budget-hebq (which contains lkor); tip c186f6f. sync.ts conflict resolved: lkor's raw_payload/raw_received_at in the connection_transactions INSERT, and the raw refresh UPDATE for existing shadowed rows now runs inside the row's SAVEPOINT before the blocked/duplicate decision; skipped rows (deleted/other account) get no raw write. Test fixups: sync-idempotent.test.ts up() gains raw, sync.test.ts duplicate-refresh test expects emptySyncResult(). All four packages: tsc, eslint, bun test pass (api 1207 pass with BUDGET_REQUIRE_TEST_DB=1 on :55432). Skip banner checked at 375/390/768/1400 with long and unbroken account names: wraps, no overflow, no fix needed (evidence ev-d6a478, ev-34294a).\nlanded outside tk close at c186f6f (branch tk/budget-1iym merged into main by hand)\nMerged to main (c186f6f): sync skips bank ids already imported anywhere (deleted/other account), per-row SAVEPOINT, skip banner on bank page (ev-d6a478 ev-34294a), 5 regression tests. Rebased on lkor+hebq; shared 167, api 1207, client 1246, admin 20 pass.",
  "design": null,
  "acceptance_criteria": "Lookup by (provider, external id) across all accounts incl. deleted; found => skip (deleted stays deleted, row in another account stays there), counted as skipped with a reason. A per-row failure is recorded and does not abort the run. Skip counts + reasons shown on the bank page (i18n en + pt-BR). Regression tests: user-deleted row, sync-tombstoned row, row in an old unlinked account, re-running the same sync twice is a no-op.",
  "estimated_minutes": null,
  "spec_id": null,
  "external_ref": null,
